        "original_id": "5586538d-cf74-50fc-9ab0-71793afea51f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Naughty Boy, Popcaan, Themba Sekowe\n- Songs: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\", \"Should've Been Me\"\n- Albums: \"Views\"\n- Roles: rapper, record producer, disk jockey, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Themba Sekowe, born in 1988, is the South African record producer and disk jockey known as DJ Maphorisa.\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper, and \"One Dance\" is a song from his fourth studio album \"Views\" released in 2016.\n- Kyla is best known for her song \"Do You Mind,\" which later appeared on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance.\"\n- \"Should've Been Me\" is a song by British record producer Naughty Boy featuring vocals from Kyla and Popcaan.",
